{
  "title": "Unique Dense Ethiopian Peanuts Azifa",
  "description": "A citrusy and dense Ethiopian dish featuring peanuts, this azifa is perfect for midnight cravings and is low-fat-friendly, with a unique nigiri-shaped form.",
